## Release contract

- Record build inputs, artifacts, promotion steps, approvals, and environment differences.
- Identify configuration and secret sources without storing secret values.
- Define health checks, migration order, rollback conditions, and recovery steps where applicable.
- Record observability and ownership needed to judge a release.
- Link each active environment to current authoritative configuration.

